{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2382e8",
      "back_en": "...What are you talking about?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23845d",
      "back_en": "when I'm right here in front of her...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2384bc",
      "back_en": "right next to my collar.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23853a",
      "back_en": "What the hell is a Ku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Tom levemente mais brando, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238557",
      "back_en": "You smell like Ku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23859c",
      "back_en": "by 'Ku' in the first place. I don't know an—",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Corte coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2386f2",
      "back_en": "A... Ar... Aru...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238706",
      "back_en": "Aru?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238b4f",
      "back_en": "She was one of those beauties from Tuskur.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238ba4",
      "back_en": "And what did she mean by Ku...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238cec",
      "back_en": "woman, lying face-down with belly bared.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'spread-eagled' (braços/pernas abertos) virou 'de bruços', que contradiz 'belly bared'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238d62",
      "back_en": "wait a minute. Maybe I HAVE seen her before...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Ênfase no verbo HAVE deslocada para o pronome EU."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239057",
      "back_en": "*Big mouth* Welcome back, Ku.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'*Yawn*' (bocejo) traduzido como '*Boca grande*'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239070",
      "back_en": "Ku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2390fa",
      "back_en": "this whole time.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23913b",
      "back_en": "send letters... I was so worri--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239168",
      "back_en": "M-Mister... Hak--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2391b6",
      "back_en": "Waaaah!? Wh-Why aren't you Ku!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23934c",
      "back_en": "Tuskur would show up here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2394ad",
      "back_en": "...of hers...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239548",
      "back_en": "Wh-What--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Condensado mas equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2395e1",
      "back_en": "...Invisibility?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2395f2",
      "back_en": "...Can you see me?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'by any chance' omitido, sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239645",
      "back_en": "I see you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23979f",
      "back_en": "Farewell then!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2398cd",
      "back_en": "likes someone like that.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239941",
      "back_en": "Must really like you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239b24",
      "back_en": "So you came to look for someone?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239b6d",
      "back_en": "I don't know how I made a mistake like this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239bf2",
      "back_en": "My room?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239cbb",
      "back_en": "this was her room. I don't get it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239d15",
      "back_en": "Yes! She's the cutest thing in the whole world!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239d71",
      "back_en": "A nickname like 'Ku' really narrows the options.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239df9",
      "back_en": "It feels good when I hug her.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239e41",
      "back_en": "sound of a bell. I love to hear her shout 'Sister'!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239f40",
      "back_en": "So this 'Ku' would be Kuon in full name?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239f8b",
      "back_en": "Wrong!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239fce",
      "back_en": "I've never heard of anyone like that before!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a05d",
      "back_en": "Her reasons...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a099",
      "back_en": "About her, you must be physically near Kuon.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'really close with' (próximo/íntimo) virou 'bem perto' (proximidade física)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a12b",
      "back_en": "Enough influence to be an ambassador, huh...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a184",
      "back_en": "Background, but...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a52e",
      "back_en": "taking care of me. I owe my life to Kuon.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a60f",
      "back_en": "together with Ku!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a622",
      "back_en": "Standing by each other in good and bad times...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23aa28",
      "back_en": "So why HIM...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ae7e",
      "back_en": "Hey, Haku... would you do THAT for me?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23af0f",
      "back_en": "K-Ku! She's so direct about it!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b1cf",
      "back_en": "would let a man touch her legs like that...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b467",
      "back_en": "Ku's all grown up...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b481",
      "back_en": "She has the expression of an adult woman.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'mulher' adicionado, contextual."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b524",
      "back_en": "and rips off the blankets covering the two.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b6c3",
      "back_en": "What are those two doing here...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b6e6",
      "back_en": "Hahahaha, looks like you found out...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b710",
      "back_en": "It's been a while, Ku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b7f7",
      "back_en": "acquaintances...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b96f",
      "back_en": "your feelings back to then, but things changed...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'back then' (naquela época) traduzido literal como 'de volta então'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b9e5",
      "back_en": "I trusted you and it went really bad for me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Gíria 'deu ruim' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ba41",
      "back_en": "introduce me to your guy, right, Kuon?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Ku' virou 'Kuon', inconsistência menor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23bc86",
      "back_en": "embarrassing past is revealed to me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ebe7",
      "back_en": "Could we share this table with you?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ed05",
      "back_en": "Yeah, are you sure you wouldn't prefer to--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Uh' suavizado, OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ed5a",
      "back_en": "sit on the other side of my table.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ed84",
      "back_en": "Young master, please. Here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23edd5",
      "back_en": "piercing gaze, seated right in front of me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ee2e",
      "back_en": "Sharp-eyed man",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ee6f",
      "back_en": "quietly, with a serious expression.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'surly' (mal-humorado/rabugento) virou 'séria' (séria)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23eeb8",
      "back_en": "Although I don't know if I'd call him 'young'...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ef47",
      "back_en": "prince.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23efae",
      "back_en": "helpers...? Yeah, something like that...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'squires'=escudeiros virou 'ajudantes', aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f182",
      "back_en": "No, we just met right now.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f19e",
      "back_en": "We asked to share a table.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f1ec",
      "back_en": "we wished to talk with one of the locals here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f296",
      "back_en": "Can we simply trust your judgement?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f2e8",
      "back_en": "recommendations? Oh, and money is no problem.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f9ef",
      "back_en": "'homeland' of his. I wonder where he's from?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23fe74",
      "back_en": "Here, young one. One for you too.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ff2d",
      "back_en": "What kind of thing do you eat in your country?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240afd",
      "back_en": "Now is the time to prove yourself!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240b84",
      "back_en": "Both (female) twins",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Gênero assumido feminino; contextual."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240cc8",
      "back_en": "and measured responses to everything I say.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240d4d",
      "back_en": "happened to me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240d7c",
      "back_en": "What a peculiar story...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Leve mudança de nuance, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x240dc9",
      "back_en": "unconscious. You were very lucky indeed...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2411a9",
      "back_en": "My daughter is far more beautiful.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241227",
      "back_en": "Would you like to hear about her?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241259",
      "back_en": "Very well then! I shall tell you.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Devo contar' levemente off, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2412a8",
      "back_en": "father could wish for.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2412ef",
      "back_en": "unparalleled, and her charm is incomparable.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24131f",
      "back_en": "...I think it was three, not one.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241373",
      "back_en": "a mystic quality bordering on the ethereal--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241455",
      "back_en": "My daughter DEFINES stunning beauty.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24154c",
      "back_en": "yet full of warmth...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'calor' aceitável p/ warmth."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241637",
      "back_en": "He might... just MIGHT... be exaggerating a bit.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241668",
      "back_en": "...He's talking about only one daughter, right?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241764",
      "back_en": "smile won everyone's hearts.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'melted' virou 'conquistou', nuance leve, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2417e1",
      "back_en": "spell...!'",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241c6a",
      "back_en": "him from drinking more than he can handle...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241d80",
      "back_en": "Young Master, that liquor is very strong.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241e18",
      "back_en": "I'm not a man who gets carried away by mere alcohol.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'laid low' (derrubado/abatido) virou 'se deixa levar' (carregar)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x241e47",
      "back_en": "*Gulp* *plop*",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia aproximada, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24223d",
      "back_en": "...You no longer have a choice.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24228a",
      "back_en": "beautiful, and so kind...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x242332",
      "back_en": "a name means longevity...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2423a3",
      "back_en": "needs to work on that...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2424d8",
      "back_en": "a long, healthy life...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24251e",
      "back_en": "happy again...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24255f",
      "back_en": "so much... like her mother...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x242f46",
      "back_en": "I want to ask her something, but I hold myself back.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x242fa4",
      "back_en": "companionable peace that I learned to know well.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'grown so used to' (acostumei) virou 'aprendi a conhecer bem'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x237dec",
      "back_en": "Even though we're basically their minions, they",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238079",
      "back_en": "She's wriggling as if struggling",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2380a8",
      "back_en": "to move.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238416",
      "back_en": "Evidence vanished.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'disposed of' (descartada) virou 'desaparecida' (sumiu)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2387ee",
      "back_en": "Aru (?) stands in front of the (female) worker and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23896d",
      "back_en": "Aru responds only with a tilt of her head,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x238f31",
      "back_en": "However disappointing it is, she's",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'the sight' omitido, OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x239f92",
      "back_en": "...Which is it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a264",
      "back_en": "Probably not blood-related to Kuon, but I can",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a567",
      "back_en": "So Ku saved your life?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a57e",
      "back_en": "Yeah. When I was abandoned in the wilderness to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23a8a6",
      "back_en": "that. Why are you so happy about it, anyway?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23aa09",
      "back_en": "Her standards are very high...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23ac7e",
      "back_en": "...Did either of you think that I could",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23aeb9",
      "back_en": "Kuon sits, rolling up the hem of her",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23afcd",
      "back_en": "really fast, but...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b03a",
      "back_en": "Oh, she wants me to massage her legs like",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'masse' verbo informal, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b0ee",
      "back_en": "Oh... Mf, right there...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b14b",
      "back_en": "I continue following Kuon's requests,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23b2b9",
      "back_en": "Hmm, naughty...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23e826",
      "back_en": "deserted in the middle of the night like this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23f6cc",
      "back_en": "country.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "OK."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x23fa4e",
      "back_en": "it'd be rude of me to pressure someone I just met.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'pry' (bisbilhotar) virou 'pressionar' (pressure), nuance diferente."
    },
    {
